{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"185491","name":"Appart'City Confort Lyon Cite Internationale","description":"The Appart'City Lyon Cité Internationale aparthotel offers 158 private, fully furnished apartments in a quiet area of Caluire, just outside Lyon. A short five-minute drive from the Lyon Centre des Congrès conference center, this aparthotel provides convenient access for business travelers. Each apartment features a Chromecast TV and a fully equipped kitchen with a ceramic hob, microwave, kettle, and fridge. Ranging from double studios to spacious four-person apartments, the Appart'City caters to both business trips and leisure stays. Guests can enjoy 24/7 on-site support, a lift, and free Wi-Fi. Nearby, the Tête d'Or Park and its zoo offer entertainment for all ages, and the Croix-Rousse district boasts stunning views of Lyon. The city center, a 20-minute metro ride from the nearby station, beckons with its renowned bouchon restaurants. The on-site Bistrot City restaurant serves delicious, healthy meals made with fresh, hand-selected ingredients. Open Monday to Friday for lunch and dinner, the restaurant provides a contemporary dining experience. Reception is open 24/7. Breakfast is served from 6:30 am to 10:00 am on weekdays and from 7:00 am to 11:00 am on weekends.","address":"Grande Rue De Saint Clair, 157","city":"CALUIRE ET CUIRE-LYON","countryCode":"FR","postalCode":"69300","lat":45.790968,"lng":4.859733,"stars":3,"chain":"APPAR","giataCode":"365552","phone":"+33820001555","email":"lyon-citeinternationale@appartcity.com","website":"www.appartcity.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/18/185491/185491a_hb_a_565.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/18/185491/185491a_hb_a_566_20260707_123045.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/18/185491/185491a_hb_l_002_20250520_140842.jpg","category":"lobby","order":2},{"url":"https: